{"mode":"words","text":"Laat de tekst daarna op de achtergrond verder spelen — terwijl je opruimt, een wandeling maakt of in slaap valt. Je hoeft niet geconcentreerd te luisteren: je hersenen nemen de klank en de melodie van de taal vanzelf in zich op. Dat is precies de voorbereiding op het spreken.","words":[{"s":0,"e":290},{"s":313,"e":372},{"s":441,"e":731},{"s":755,"e":1149},{"s":1242,"e":1347},{"s":1393,"e":1440},{"s":1509,"e":2113},{"s":2438,"e":2752},{"s":2786,"e":3297},{"s":3413,"e":3460},{"s":3843,"e":4145},{"s":4214,"e":4272},{"s":4354,"e":5050},{"s":5074,"e":5166},{"s":5224,"e":5596},{"s":5654,"e":6060},{"s":6385,"e":6525},{"s":6594,"e":6653},{"s":6722,"e":7024},{"s":7105,"e":7605},{"s":7930,"e":8022},{"s":8057,"e":8255},{"s":8290,"e":8464},{"s":8522,"e":9242},{"s":9276,"e":9346},{"s":9427,"e":10135},{"s":10460,"e":10530},{"s":10588,"e":11052},{"s":11169,"e":11436},{"s":11470,"e":11517},{"s":11575,"e":11970},{"s":12353,"e":12527},{"s":12573,"e":12620},{"s":12678,"e":13258},{"s":13386,"e":13537},{"s":13583,"e":13642},{"s":13688,"e":14059},{"s":14176,"e":14791},{"s":14907,"e":15023},{"s":15070,"e":15220},{"s":15290,"e":15615},{"s":15998,"e":16138},{"s":16172,"e":16242},{"s":16300,"e":16718},{"s":16776,"e":16834},{"s":16892,"e":17566},{"s":17682,"e":17798},{"s":17821,"e":17891},{"s":17914,"e":18808}]}